WEBVTT

00:00:00.170 --> 00:00:01.590
'Hey, what are you doing?'

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:03.940
'Please save
my wife somehow, Doctor.'

00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:04.940
'Teju, I have an idea.'

00:00:05.220 --> 00:00:07.750
'I can't do it,
but you can do it, right?'

00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.380
'Oh, God!'

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:13.440
'You are happy
only when you do that.'

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.360
'Then you should do that, Mom.'

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.250
'Both the kids have complications.'

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:18.640
'One kid has kidney failure.'

00:00:18.900 --> 00:00:21.170
'Another kid doesn't have
a heart that functions properly.'

00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:23.250
'To do such
a high-level transplant'

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:26.200
'we need an experienced
surgeon like you, sir.'

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.320
'Who?'

00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:28.510
'Dr. Radhi.'

00:00:45.940 --> 00:00:48.860
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:53.610
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.190
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:03.140
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:01:03.480 --> 00:01:05.790
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:08.640
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.390
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:01:13.560 --> 00:01:16.310
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:21.310
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:01:23.190 --> 00:01:27.380
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:51.170
Write it correctly.
- Hi, juniors.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:53.060
Hi, Guna.
- What are you doing?

00:01:53.110 --> 00:01:54.580
Can't you see? We are taking notes.

00:01:54.640 --> 00:01:57.000
Dude, come on. Come here.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.550
Come. Sit down.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.000
I have been looking
for you since morning.

00:02:01.150 --> 00:02:02.410
When did you look for him?

00:02:02.460 --> 00:02:03.980
You shut up.

00:02:05.790 --> 00:02:07.630
It's not like you
to give me so much respect.

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:09.070
What is the matter?

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:11.580
Nothing. I am thinking
of shifting my house.

00:02:11.630 --> 00:02:12.970
You are shifting your house?

00:02:13.050 --> 00:02:15.730
Why? Did they increase the rent?

00:02:15.780 --> 00:02:17.310
Or is the landlord troubling you?

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:19.650
No. You have wooed
the landlord's daughter.

00:02:19.680 --> 00:02:21.220
Hey!
- Did they beat you?

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:23.260
What about Charu?
- You drunkard!

00:02:23.390 --> 00:02:24.400
Do you want a reply or not?

00:02:24.810 --> 00:02:25.730
Go ahead.

00:02:29.230 --> 00:02:32.580
Oh, the cinema doctor
is calling me. Don't die.

00:02:32.740 --> 00:02:34.250
I will be fine without you.
- Bye.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.490
He will never get a house
with that hairstyle.

00:02:37.030 --> 00:02:37.850
Did you hear that?

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.560
We address seniors as seniors.

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.660
But they call us by our names.

00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:43.960
So bad.

00:02:44.500 --> 00:02:46.960
Maybe they can't accept you
as a senior.

00:02:47.710 --> 00:02:49.080
Come to the point.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.720
Why do you want to vacate
the house suddenly?

00:02:50.750 --> 00:02:53.240
There's nothing sudden about it.
I've been planning it for a while.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:56.090
My current house
gets flooded easily.

00:02:56.340 --> 00:02:58.110
It won't survive another storm.

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.080
That's why I wanted
to ask you for help.

00:03:02.720 --> 00:03:03.620
What help?

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:06.920
Can you help me find
a house in your building?

00:03:07.280 --> 00:03:08.680
There?
- Of course.

00:03:09.260 --> 00:03:12.530
I won't get you a house there.
I will help you get one elsewhere.

00:03:12.600 --> 00:03:13.480
Why?

00:03:13.580 --> 00:03:15.360
How do I answer you so suddenly?

00:03:15.800 --> 00:03:17.820
You can't afford the rent there.

00:03:18.090 --> 00:03:18.980
Oh.

00:03:19.120 --> 00:03:22.730
The difference between your salary
and mine is Rs. 2,000 only.

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:25.750
Why do you want a house there?

00:03:26.910 --> 00:03:28.880
When I visited your house
for the party

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:30.380
I really liked the vibe.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:34.560
Rocky, I will get you
a similar house...

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.550
No, a house better than mine...

00:03:36.800 --> 00:03:38.000
I'll help you find it
somewhere else, okay?

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.560
No, I want a house there.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:44.370
You bring a girl home every day
and are enjoying that big house.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.820
Don't you wish the same
for your friend? - Hey..

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:48.730
Don't shout, keep quiet.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.490
You want a house, right?
- Yes.

00:03:52.690 --> 00:03:54.870
I will take care of it.
- Thanks, dude.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:03:59.490
I have a doubt.
- What?

00:03:59.580 --> 00:04:03.130
Do you want a house there
because you like my building?

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:05.050
Or do you want to see what I do?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:06.840
What do you do?

00:04:07.830 --> 00:04:08.820
I don't do anything.

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:11.230
Then, it's the house.
Just the house.

00:04:12.380 --> 00:04:13.790
Why do I put up with you?

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:16.660
Okay. I am leaving.

00:04:17.250 --> 00:04:20.570
Hey! Work properly and uphold the
honours of this hospital, junior.

00:04:21.050 --> 00:04:21.970
Okay, senior.

00:04:22.010 --> 00:04:24.220
You go and get beat up
by your senior.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:25.720
I like doing that.

00:04:25.760 --> 00:04:27.100
Bye!
- I know. Get lost.

00:04:28.460 --> 00:04:29.630
He will never change.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.710
How are you feeling now? Better?
- It's better now.

00:04:33.860 --> 00:04:35.340
Are you taking the pills on time?
- Yes, I am.

00:04:35.610 --> 00:04:37.220
Okay, great. Nurse!

00:04:37.690 --> 00:04:38.550
Tell me, Doctor.

00:04:39.990 --> 00:04:42.030
Give him an IV antibiotic.

00:04:42.080 --> 00:04:44.240
Okay.
- After that, give him an injection.

00:04:44.290 --> 00:04:45.440
Okay, Doctor.
- Okay.

00:04:45.480 --> 00:04:47.440
Nurse, start his discharge process.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:49.450
We will discharge him
this evening or tomorrow morning.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:50.540
Okay, Doctor.

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:54.020
Sir, stay under observation
for two days.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:55.080
Okay?
- Okay, madam.

00:04:55.710 --> 00:04:57.570
Your readings do seem fine.

00:04:57.680 --> 00:05:01.390
But only if you feel fine, you
can get discharged after two days.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:02.470
Okay?
- Okay.

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:03.980
Senior, he is fine.

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:06.100
I checked him.
He is totally alright.

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.840
That's why I asked her
to start the discharge process.

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:09.180
Okay, Doctor.
- Sir.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:10.950
Sir, don't worry.
We can discharge you

00:05:11.000 --> 00:05:11.880
soon.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:05:12.560 --> 00:05:13.630
Okay, take care.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:21.750
Okay, sir. Take care.

00:05:25.600 --> 00:05:28.070
The next two patients are
under post-op observation, right?

00:05:28.830 --> 00:05:29.650
Yes, Anitha.

00:05:30.870 --> 00:05:32.810
Hey, no one is looking.

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:35.100
Good morning, Doctor.

00:05:35.840 --> 00:05:36.670
Good morning.

00:05:44.640 --> 00:05:46.030
Hi, ma'am. Hello, sir.

00:05:46.300 --> 00:05:47.530
How are you now?
- Hi, ma'am.

00:05:47.590 --> 00:05:49.270
Are you able to manage the pain?

00:05:49.310 --> 00:05:52.830
At first, I was in pain.
Then, they gave me an injection.

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:54.150
Now, I am fine.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:55.410
That's good.

00:05:56.010 --> 00:05:57.500
That means you're recovering.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.080
If it gets unbearable, let me know.
I'll prescribe a painkiller a day.

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.470
Look at her, Doctor.

00:06:03.650 --> 00:06:05.910
She doesn't even eat properly
because of the pain.

00:06:06.070 --> 00:06:07.950
Look, he is complaining about you.

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.770
If you want to take painkillers
you have to eat well.

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:12.880
Only then
will the painkillers work?

00:06:14.490 --> 00:06:16.740
Tomorrow afternoon, the
ortho doctor will come and see you.

00:06:16.790 --> 00:06:19.030
After he sees you,
we can discharge you, okay?

00:06:19.210 --> 00:06:22.160
He will explain to you
about the physio procedure.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:24.010
Okay, Doctor.
- Senior.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:26.090
Let's observe her for two days.

00:06:26.140 --> 00:06:27.710
Look, the counts are also high.

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:30.410
Let's give her some antibiotics for
two days and then discharge her.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:35.090
This is common
for knee surgery patients.

00:06:35.730 --> 00:06:37.900
Fix a physio appointment for them

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.580
and explain her discharge summary.

00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:42.530
Okay, senior.

00:06:44.640 --> 00:06:46.060
Okay, sir. I'll leave.

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.840
Okay, madam.
- Okay, Doctor. - Take care.

00:06:48.780 --> 00:06:49.660
Hey!

00:06:52.010 --> 00:06:54.180
First, you called me by name.

00:06:54.570 --> 00:06:57.100
You're acting like a know-it-all
in front of the patients.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.400
I didn't mean it.

00:06:58.460 --> 00:07:01.090
If you want to reject
instructions from a senior doctor

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.820
don't you know
how to do it politely?

00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:05.360
Anitha, I'm telling you politely.

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:07.460
First, stop calling me Anitha.

00:07:11.060 --> 00:07:13.160
Okay, senior.
It won't happen again.

00:07:24.240 --> 00:07:25.070
Hi, Reena.

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:35.420
Hey, Amaya.

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.540
Is everyone coming on time now?

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:40.140
Are they following
the new rules correctly?

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:51.070
Reena, if you take out your anger
on Amaya, will everything be fine?

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:53.230
What can she do
for the rules set by Arjun?

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.110
I didn't mean to hurt Amaya.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:07:59.020
This is not a new rule
like you think.

00:07:59.140 --> 00:08:00.530
It's always been there.

00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.690
In fact, what Arjun says
is the actual rule.

00:08:04.140 --> 00:08:07.800
When Dr. Radhi was here
she handled it differently.

00:08:07.990 --> 00:08:09.730
So, she didn't fine anyone.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:14.020
Moreover, when Dr. Radhi was
here, you all came on time, right?

00:08:14.080 --> 00:08:15.400
Because of the fear for her.

00:08:15.790 --> 00:08:18.010
Your CEO is doing so well
when it comes to the staff.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.360
But why is he messing up
when it comes to patients?

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:21.700
Why, what happened?

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.710
It's such
a complicated case, Aruna.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:27.120
We have to save
at least one child out of the two.

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.180
We don't know
if we have time for that.

00:08:29.740 --> 00:08:31.230
We have to find
another surgeon too.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:33.070
Does he care about all this?

00:08:33.980 --> 00:08:35.320
If he doesn't know

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:37.240
he should at least
listen to us, right?

00:08:37.640 --> 00:08:40.580
Who is a better choice
than Dr. Radhi for this case?

00:08:43.840 --> 00:08:46.820
When there is so much to do,
he's focusing on some stupid rules.

00:08:48.030 --> 00:08:51.560
Reena, this is not
as easy as you think, Reena.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.620
We don't know the kind of pressure
he is under, from the management

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.490
nor do we know how many people
he has to talk to.

00:08:56.830 --> 00:08:59.930
If you ask me
if Dr. Radhi will come

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.850
I'd say the chances are very low.

00:09:02.880 --> 00:09:07.050
Because she is very strong in her
decision that she won't come.

00:09:08.130 --> 00:09:09.490
Arjun is the CEO, yes.

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:12.340
He can't take a one-sided decision.

00:09:13.220 --> 00:09:15.900
If Dr. Radhi declines our request

00:09:16.040 --> 00:09:18.710
we have to get
a back-up surgeon, right?

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:21.040
This is not an easy task, Reena.

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:23.910
He has to think a lot
before taking a move.

00:09:25.620 --> 00:09:26.640
I understand, Aruna.

00:09:27.340 --> 00:09:29.920
Arjun knows the seriousness
of this situation.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:31.700
This is a matter of life and death.

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:36.040
It will be better if he keeps his
ego aside and talks to Dr. Radhi.

00:09:51.260 --> 00:09:53.250
Give me that chutney.

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:04.970
If you sit here
without talking to anyone

00:10:05.310 --> 00:10:07.380
I can see that there is a problem.

00:10:07.820 --> 00:10:09.040
What is the problem?

00:10:10.780 --> 00:10:13.800
Radhi, why did you quit your job?

00:10:14.070 --> 00:10:16.730
I know how much you love your job.

00:10:17.030 --> 00:10:20.380
But, you are sitting idle at home.

00:10:22.630 --> 00:10:24.500
I don't know the reason for this.

00:10:26.830 --> 00:10:27.970
Why are you looking at me?

00:10:29.140 --> 00:10:31.410
Are you saying I am the reason
your daughter quit her job?

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:34.770
I didn't say that.
- Nobody asked me to resign.

00:10:35.300 --> 00:10:36.550
I decided it myself.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:40.610
Why? Wouldn't I want to spend time
with my family and kids?

00:10:40.920 --> 00:10:42.290
Can't I take a break?

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:52.410
Then, why don't you and your
husband talk to each other?

00:10:53.650 --> 00:10:55.620
Every family has its own problems.

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.990
We will solve it.

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:06.560
We will solve
the problems between us.

00:11:06.830 --> 00:11:08.390
Why are you interfering?

00:11:08.830 --> 00:11:10.600
It's not that, I..

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:13.470
I..

00:11:14.470 --> 00:11:15.810
Why did you come here?

00:11:16.330 --> 00:11:18.330
I came to see you all.

00:11:18.740 --> 00:11:19.630
You saw us, right?

00:11:20.680 --> 00:11:22.280
Get back to your work.

00:11:22.310 --> 00:11:24.640
And don't interfere in everything.

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:33.700
Oh!

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:40.780
Ganesh, where are you?

00:11:45.750 --> 00:11:48.130
Ma'am, how are the babies?

00:11:48.710 --> 00:11:50.320
Ma'am, they didn't even
let me see them.

00:11:50.420 --> 00:11:54.120
Sir, in this situation
the babies'' immunity is very low.

00:11:54.420 --> 00:11:57.210
Nobody is allowed
except doctors and nurses.

00:11:58.470 --> 00:11:59.340
I understand, ma'am.

00:12:00.340 --> 00:12:02.130
Ever since Amritha got pregnant

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:05.950
my family and I were very happy.

00:12:06.060 --> 00:12:07.700
After we found out
that it was twins

00:12:09.310 --> 00:12:10.880
everyone was very happy.

00:12:12.570 --> 00:12:17.070
But when I got to know that none of
the children will survive...

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:20.670
I don't know what to do, ma'am.

00:12:21.630 --> 00:12:23.880
Save them somehow, ma'am.
Please.

00:12:24.410 --> 00:12:25.750
Save them somehow.

00:12:26.380 --> 00:12:30.460
Sir, we need two experienced
surgeons to perform this surgery.

00:12:30.790 --> 00:12:32.700
One surgeon is in our hospital.

00:12:33.460 --> 00:12:36.130
We are still searching
for the other surgeon, sir.

00:12:36.470 --> 00:12:38.790
If we find them, we can start soon.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.540
But, you need to wait
till then, sir. Please.

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.810
But how long do we have to wait...
- Hi, sir.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:47.130
Hi, sir.
- I have some good news for you.

00:12:47.780 --> 00:12:49.140
We have located a surgeon.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:52.980
Once he comes here,
we will analyse the situation

00:12:53.230 --> 00:12:54.810
and plan the surgery immediately.

00:12:55.180 --> 00:12:58.850
Sir, who is he?
- He is my colleague.

00:12:59.490 --> 00:13:02.060
He has handled many
complicated cases like this.

00:13:02.110 --> 00:13:02.950
He is from Hyderabad.

00:13:04.190 --> 00:13:07.770
Oh.. Sir, are you doing
the surgery immediately?

00:13:07.860 --> 00:13:10.430
Once he comes here,
he will conduct some tests.

00:13:11.330 --> 00:13:14.210
Once the condition
of the babies stabilize

00:13:14.440 --> 00:13:15.980
we can have the surgery
within two days.

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:17.730
Nothing to worry. All is well.

00:13:17.880 --> 00:13:20.090
Oh! Thank you so much, sir.

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:21.890
It's okay. Relax.
- Thank you so much.

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:22.760
Thank you.

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:23.740
Arjun.
- No problem.

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:25.240
Okay.

00:13:28.140 --> 00:13:29.100
Thank God!

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:30.970
Thank God!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.380
Hi, Reena. Why are you late today?
- Hi, Aunt.

00:13:37.050 --> 00:13:38.970
I had a lot of work today.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:40.870
Okay, freshen up and come.

00:13:40.990 --> 00:13:43.170
You can have dinner.
- I've already eaten. You go ahead.

00:13:43.300 --> 00:13:45.480
Okay.
- Where is uncle?

00:13:47.250 --> 00:13:49.230
Go upstairs and check.

00:13:49.870 --> 00:13:51.250
You'll see.
- Upstairs?

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:53.210
What is he doing?

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.070
Careful.

00:14:01.050 --> 00:14:03.090
Nothing can beat
the songs of our time.

00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:06.230
Have you heard
the songs these days?

00:14:07.180 --> 00:14:11.010
Singer MSV was at the peak!
- Yes! He was at the peak!

00:14:12.850 --> 00:14:13.740
Look at this.

00:14:15.020 --> 00:14:16.200
The doctor is coming.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:20.130
Come, Reena.

00:14:20.190 --> 00:14:22.650
We meet often these days.

00:14:23.280 --> 00:14:24.270
Yes, sir.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:26.350
I am scared because of that.

00:14:26.780 --> 00:14:30.300
What?
- Nothing, sir. What is this?

00:14:30.500 --> 00:14:32.600
You got your blood sugar tests
and got pills for it.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:34.300
Why are you two drinking now?

00:14:34.350 --> 00:14:38.470
It is because I have blood sugar,
no cola, no lime, no orange.

00:14:38.720 --> 00:14:41.000
The apples are for him
and the cucumbers are for me.

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:43.880
Don't scold him.
He is a very good boy. - Yes.

00:14:44.340 --> 00:14:45.580
What are you doing here?

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:48.490
I am..
- Don't scold him. He's a good boy.

00:14:48.600 --> 00:14:50.860
Are you both teasing me?

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:53.250
No, no, no... No teasing.

00:14:53.310 --> 00:14:54.670
No teasing.
- Only mixing.

00:14:56.440 --> 00:14:58.250
Only two rounds.
Then we will go home.

00:14:59.940 --> 00:15:00.800
Dear..

00:15:02.070 --> 00:15:06.000
Dear, I was not in a good mood.

00:15:06.070 --> 00:15:07.140
I was upset.

00:15:08.370 --> 00:15:09.770
I needed company.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:11.340
That's why I came here.

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:14.840
He was tired
and waiting for company.

00:15:14.880 --> 00:15:18.250
So we decided to go for social
drinking... She doesn't know it.

00:15:18.880 --> 00:15:19.720
Uncle.

00:15:20.630 --> 00:15:21.840
Don't tell him about me.

00:15:22.260 --> 00:15:24.190
What? Shouldn't I
tell him anything?

00:15:24.720 --> 00:15:26.990
Uncle, he doesn't know about us.

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:28.750
She doesn't know something.
What do you not know?

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:29.990
Uncle.
- I don't know.

00:15:30.050 --> 00:15:30.910
Ganesh.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.430
Uncle, uncle, uncle...
- She doesn't know...

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:35.170
Do you know? She's calling me.
- Come here for a minute, please.

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:36.120
Come back soon.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:39.060
What don't you know?
What are you trying to say?

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:41.620
Uncle.
- She doesn't know anything.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.040
Slowly.
- I don't know...

00:15:43.130 --> 00:15:44.610
Be careful.

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:47.190
Be careful with him.
- Come on.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:48.710
He might fall.

00:15:49.620 --> 00:15:50.480
I know.
- Hey!

00:15:50.680 --> 00:15:52.320
Did you say 'hey'?
- Hush!

00:15:53.540 --> 00:15:56.330
If you blabber something to him
after drinking, I'll kill you.

00:15:57.040 --> 00:15:59.380
He doesn't know
what's happening here.

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:00.480
Do you understand?

00:16:01.020 --> 00:16:02.980
I understood you calling me 'hey'.

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:04.280
I understood.
- Okay.

00:16:04.630 --> 00:16:06.120
Then..
- What?

00:16:06.260 --> 00:16:09.020
There is a packet of chips
in the kitchen downstairs.

00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.300
Can you bring it here...

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.750
Okay, okay, I'll bring it.

00:16:12.860 --> 00:16:14.360
I said okay.

00:16:15.860 --> 00:16:18.430
She gets angry like her mother.
Exactly like a mother.

00:16:19.810 --> 00:16:20.720
Okay.

00:16:21.190 --> 00:16:24.010
How do I go back now?
I don't have anyone to lean on.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.000
Shall I sit?
- Sit, sit.

00:16:29.050 --> 00:16:30.180
Slowly.
- Oh, God..

00:16:30.320 --> 00:16:31.170
What did she want?

00:16:31.780 --> 00:16:34.750
She is stressed in the hospital.
She is taking it out on me.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:37.120
I'm taking my stress out on you.

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:39.630
She is taking
her stress out on you.

00:16:39.670 --> 00:16:41.850
You take your stress out on this.

00:16:42.500 --> 00:16:43.380
Drink up!

00:17:07.400 --> 00:17:08.830
Good morning.
- Hi.

00:17:09.890 --> 00:17:11.430
What is it, Uncle?

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.550
We didn't want to approach you.

00:17:15.790 --> 00:17:18.310
We tried not to, but.

00:17:18.660 --> 00:17:21.340
The situation... The situ..
What is that word?

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:23.020
I am a prisoner of the situation.

00:17:23.090 --> 00:17:24.990
We are prisoners of the situation.
- Oh, God..

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.200
Please tell me what it is.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:28.920
What should I say?

00:17:29.170 --> 00:17:32.180
If I go to sleep on an empty stomach
after drinking alcohol...

00:17:32.220 --> 00:17:34.240
What's that again? Ability? Acidity!
- Acidity.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:35.740
The doctor says we'll get acidity.

00:17:35.890 --> 00:17:37.790
Oh! Did the doctor say that?
- Yes!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:38.980
The doctor said that!
- Have some food and sleep.

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.700
How can I eat?
- How do we eat?

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:43.710
Why are you asking me that, Uncle?

00:17:43.770 --> 00:17:45.270
Ask Aunt to make something for you.

00:17:46.770 --> 00:17:48.940
We did ask your aunt...

00:17:49.480 --> 00:17:51.830
He asked her very politely.

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:56.660
I asked her to make me some dosa
since I am her husband.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.200
But she kicked me out.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:07.170
Tried all food apps. No restaurant
has what we want. - All are closed.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:08.770
What do you want me
to do about that?

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:11.960
Make three dosas for us.
Three for me and three for him.

00:18:12.850 --> 00:18:13.830
Dosa?

00:18:14.180 --> 00:18:16.450
I'm asking you like a daughter.
Like a daughter, please!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:17.380
One plate each.

00:18:17.510 --> 00:18:18.980
You can ask like that for your age.

00:18:19.030 --> 00:18:21.510
I'm asking you
like you're my granddaughter.

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:23.720
I'm hungry.

00:19:48.520 --> 00:19:49.740
Raghu.

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.950
The sambar will be a bit spicy.

00:19:54.150 --> 00:19:57.010
Because Reena likes spicy food.

00:19:57.240 --> 00:20:00.090
So Sarada makes spicy food.

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:02.490
It's the same in our house.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:05.870
Radhi doesn't like bland food.

00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:08.490
So, the food is always spicy.

00:20:08.880 --> 00:20:10.740
Did you notice something?
- What?

00:20:11.040 --> 00:20:14.800
Reena and Radhi have
a lot of similarities, do you know?

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:15.730
Did you notice that?

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.710
He has noticed it already!

00:20:18.220 --> 00:20:19.470
I think he found out.
- Uncle.

00:20:20.260 --> 00:20:21.500
Eat quickly and get up.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:22.810
I have work in the morning.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:32.110
Sir.
- Good night, Raghu.

00:20:32.150 --> 00:20:32.940
Good night.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:34.490
Good night, dear.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:36.900
Sir, be careful now...
- I sat down.

00:20:37.820 --> 00:20:38.910
Reena.

00:20:39.240 --> 00:20:41.020
Drop him at his house.

00:20:41.530 --> 00:20:42.830
His house is nearby.

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:43.950
Me?
- Yes.

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.890
Everyone is sleeping there.
How can I wake them up?

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.040
Drop him, it's okay.

00:20:47.100 --> 00:20:49.640
I can't go there, press the calling
bell and just leave him there.

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:51.110
If I go, that's it.

00:20:51.750 --> 00:20:53.000
I have the house keys.

00:20:58.760 --> 00:20:59.640
Oh, God..

00:21:02.010 --> 00:21:04.660
Slowly.
- I am looking for my shoes.

00:21:04.720 --> 00:21:06.840
I found it.
It's here.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:09.350
Left.
- Yes, sir.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:10.100
Right.
- Yes, sir.

00:21:10.480 --> 00:21:11.870
Right.
- Right...

00:21:12.810 --> 00:21:13.680
Turn around, sir.

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:15.980
Slowly, sir...

00:21:19.300 --> 00:21:20.760
That's my house.
- Yes, sir.

00:21:21.110 --> 00:21:24.480
I know! I'm intelligent.
- Okay, sir...

00:21:24.740 --> 00:21:28.510
Everyone in the area
knows my daughter.

00:21:28.750 --> 00:21:30.230
Okay, sir.

00:21:36.020 --> 00:21:36.820
Be careful.

00:21:37.210 --> 00:21:38.450
This spot is very slippery.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:40.660
Correct.

00:21:44.560 --> 00:21:46.040
Did you remove your shoes?

00:21:46.120 --> 00:21:46.900
Yes, sir.

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:48.910
I've removed them too. Okay.
- Yes, sir.

00:21:49.890 --> 00:21:51.270
Sir..
- Give me the house keys.

00:21:53.110 --> 00:21:54.150
You remember that well.

00:21:55.150 --> 00:21:56.090
Always here.

00:21:56.230 --> 00:21:57.240
Okay, sir.

00:21:57.550 --> 00:21:58.540
This side, sir.

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:01.830
Careful, sir.

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:02.900
Slowly.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:04.590
Why are you swaying so much?

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:07.420
There...
- Yes. Who else? Me?

00:22:09.790 --> 00:22:11.440
Okay. Keep the phone here.

00:22:11.700 --> 00:22:13.330
It should be near me.
- Okay, sir.

00:22:14.080 --> 00:22:16.070
I'll keep it here.
- Remove your glasses and sleep.

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:17.580
Okay?
- Okay, sir.

00:22:17.800 --> 00:22:18.620
Okay, sir.

00:22:19.130 --> 00:22:21.210
Take care of Ganesh.
- I'll take care of Ganesh.

00:22:21.260 --> 00:22:23.400
You sleep, sir. Good night.
- Good night.

00:22:23.510 --> 00:22:24.790
Close the door when you leave.

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:25.810
Okay, sir.
Perfect, sir.

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:38.040
Sir.

00:22:38.230 --> 00:22:40.010
I didn't do anything, sir.

00:22:40.610 --> 00:22:43.990
He and Uncle Ganesh
had a drink at home.

00:22:44.760 --> 00:22:45.980
After the drink

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:48.330
he couldn't walk at all.

00:22:48.660 --> 00:22:50.790
That's why I had to bring him here.

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:52.980
It's okay.
I'll take care.

00:22:54.960 --> 00:22:57.640
Sir.. I really have nothing
to do with this.

00:22:57.840 --> 00:22:59.700
It's just him and Uncle Ganesh.

00:23:01.380 --> 00:23:02.540
I said I'll take care.

00:23:05.540 --> 00:23:06.360
Sir.

00:23:07.680 --> 00:23:08.620
Sorry, sir.

00:23:09.270 --> 00:23:11.050
It's okay.
I said I'll take care.

00:23:11.600 --> 00:23:12.580
No, sir.

00:23:13.010 --> 00:23:14.520
I didn't apologise for this.

00:23:16.610 --> 00:23:18.390
You had a lot
of problems because of me.

00:23:19.190 --> 00:23:20.370
I apologise for that.

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:23.440
Why are you apologizing, Reena?

00:23:24.870 --> 00:23:27.620
When 15 years of my life
with Radhi was a lie

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.660
what will happen if you apologise?

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:32.960
You didn't do anything wrong.

00:23:36.500 --> 00:23:38.090
It's okay.
I'll take care.

00:23:40.420 --> 00:23:41.270
Sir.

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:46.020
Why can't you forgive Dr. Radhi

00:23:46.930 --> 00:23:48.630
just like you forgave me?

00:23:50.470 --> 00:23:51.570
I'm not angry with you.

00:23:52.880 --> 00:23:54.450
But you and Radhi are different.

00:23:57.940 --> 00:23:59.190
If you hadn't come here

00:24:00.270 --> 00:24:02.310
I don't know if Radhi
would have told me about it.

00:24:03.220 --> 00:24:06.480
I might not have known
the truth till the end.

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:15.010
I can never forgive Radhi.

00:25:29.235 --> 00:25:32.155
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:25:34.265 --> 00:25:36.905
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:25:39.355 --> 00:25:42.485
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:25:44.175 --> 00:25:46.435
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:25:46.775 --> 00:25:49.085
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:25:49.415 --> 00:25:51.935
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:25:52.125 --> 00:25:54.685
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:25:56.855 --> 00:25:59.605
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:26:01.855 --> 00:26:04.605
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:26:06.355 --> 00:26:10.695
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:26:37.145 --> 00:26:39.555
She is sleeping
after a long day at work.

00:26:39.715 --> 00:26:42.535
But you woke her up
and asked her to make dosa for you.

00:26:43.645 --> 00:26:44.925
I asked you.

00:26:45.605 --> 00:26:49.325
It's okay, Aunt. What if he had
blabbered something to him?

00:26:50.845 --> 00:26:53.135
Do you remember
what happened last night?

00:26:54.145 --> 00:26:56.105
I remember a little.
I'm getting old, right?

00:26:56.915 --> 00:26:57.755
Tell me now.

00:26:58.145 --> 00:26:59.105
You were like this before.

00:26:59.285 --> 00:27:01.965
You told Mr. Dev
despite me begging you not to.

00:27:02.325 --> 00:27:03.175
Now, it's his turn.

00:27:03.975 --> 00:27:06.495
I think you are getting confused.

00:27:08.245 --> 00:27:13.475
I think he will accept you
if I tell him the truth.

00:27:13.675 --> 00:27:14.915
He is not like what you think.

00:27:25.145 --> 00:27:27.475
Hello guys. Morning. Good morning.

00:27:28.365 --> 00:27:29.895
Morning, sir..
- Meet Raghav...

00:27:30.515 --> 00:27:32.595
I've already told you.

00:27:32.815 --> 00:27:35.125
My colleague from Hyderabad.
- Okay, sir...

00:27:35.235 --> 00:27:36.115
Say hi, guys.

00:27:36.175 --> 00:27:37.595
Hi, sir.
- Hi...

00:27:38.785 --> 00:27:41.675
So, Raghav and I are going
to do this surgery together.

00:27:41.785 --> 00:27:43.945
Oh, okay.
- In such a short time

00:27:43.995 --> 00:27:45.625
we got such a great surgeon.

00:27:45.825 --> 00:27:47.545
We should be very lucky.
- Thank you, thank you, sir...

00:27:47.675 --> 00:27:49.855
Raghav, meet my team.
- Hi...

00:27:49.995 --> 00:27:51.745
Why don't you introduce yourselves?

00:27:52.155 --> 00:27:54.385
Guna.
- This is Anitha.

00:27:55.255 --> 00:27:56.095
Okay.

00:27:56.345 --> 00:27:57.245
Reena, sir.

00:27:57.665 --> 00:27:58.535
Dr. Naveen, sir.

00:27:59.805 --> 00:28:02.755
If you need any details
regarding this case

00:28:02.805 --> 00:28:04.545
any reports, my team will help you.

00:28:04.685 --> 00:28:06.135
Yeah, sure, sir. Definitely.

00:28:06.995 --> 00:28:09.175
Sir, this case...
- One second.

00:28:09.975 --> 00:28:11.255
Your name is Anitha, right?

00:28:11.365 --> 00:28:12.275
Yeah, sir.

00:28:12.505 --> 00:28:13.365
Okay.

00:28:13.575 --> 00:28:15.775
Bring the files, documents

00:28:15.825 --> 00:28:17.535
and test reports regarding
this case to my cabin.

00:28:17.695 --> 00:28:19.295
Sure.
- Okay.

00:28:19.675 --> 00:28:22.795
If you send them to my cabin,
I'll start my work.

00:28:22.865 --> 00:28:23.825
Sure. Let's go.

00:28:24.075 --> 00:28:25.135
See you.
- Okay, sir...

00:28:34.725 --> 00:28:37.635
Hey Reena.
Are you angry or upset?

00:28:37.765 --> 00:28:38.635
Both.

00:28:39.465 --> 00:28:41.425
Why?
Because of Arjun?

00:28:43.295 --> 00:28:47.225
Of course. I gave Arjun a solid
reason to bring Dr. Radhi back.

00:28:47.645 --> 00:28:49.325
But he has brought
a surgeon from Hyderabad

00:28:49.595 --> 00:28:50.855
Even though
he is a renowned surgeon

00:28:50.895 --> 00:28:53.225
we know
how complicated this case is.

00:28:53.985 --> 00:28:58.945
How can we work with him
without knowing his working style?

00:28:58.995 --> 00:28:59.845
Isn't this a risk?

00:29:00.445 --> 00:29:02.575
Hold on...
Be patient.

00:29:04.095 --> 00:29:07.985
Usually, it's common
in our field to bring

00:29:08.035 --> 00:29:10.745
in a specialist to the surgery
for a complex case.

00:29:11.345 --> 00:29:12.465
You know that, right?

00:29:13.535 --> 00:29:17.555
Not only that, we can gain a lot
of experience from the new surgeon.

00:29:18.595 --> 00:29:19.565
We can learn a lot.

00:29:19.725 --> 00:29:21.255
Concentrate on that and learn.

00:29:22.405 --> 00:29:26.255
Moreover, we have a lot of time
to learn about his working style.

00:29:27.475 --> 00:29:30.935
We can figure it out
before we enter the OT.

00:29:33.095 --> 00:29:36.045
Reena, why are you
thinking unnecessarily?

00:29:36.645 --> 00:29:40.595
Instead of wasting time,
concentrate on the case.

00:29:41.195 --> 00:29:42.085
Isn't that important?

00:29:43.635 --> 00:29:44.455
Let's go.

00:29:48.985 --> 00:29:49.805
Come in.

00:29:51.715 --> 00:29:52.555
Hi, sir.

00:29:56.455 --> 00:29:57.515
What are you doing here?

00:29:57.785 --> 00:29:59.675
Sir, I came to give you
the case files.

00:30:00.645 --> 00:30:02.005
I asked Anitha to bring it.

00:30:02.385 --> 00:30:04.545
No, sir.
I'm on duty along with her.

00:30:04.755 --> 00:30:06.565
So she asked me to bring it.

00:30:07.675 --> 00:30:08.655
Is your name Anitha?

00:30:09.075 --> 00:30:09.895
Sir?

00:30:10.725 --> 00:30:12.005
Is your name Anitha?

00:30:12.595 --> 00:30:13.455
No, sir.

00:30:13.975 --> 00:30:16.155
Look, you are on duty
along with Anitha.

00:30:16.555 --> 00:30:18.005
You're doing it
because she asked you to.

00:30:20.195 --> 00:30:21.795
I don't care about any of that.

00:30:22.475 --> 00:30:24.225
Anitha can be a senior to anyone.

00:30:24.445 --> 00:30:27.645
But if I give some work to Anitha,
only she has to do it.

00:30:28.535 --> 00:30:29.425
Got it?

00:30:29.825 --> 00:30:30.665
Yes, sir.

00:30:34.125 --> 00:30:34.965
What are you doing?

00:30:35.495 --> 00:30:36.335
File, sir.

00:30:37.745 --> 00:30:38.885
Ask Anitha to bring it.

00:30:49.185 --> 00:30:50.015
Sign here.

00:30:50.305 --> 00:30:51.795
Did you check?
- Yes, Doctor...

00:30:56.265 --> 00:30:57.705
Why didn't you give him the file?

00:30:58.275 --> 00:31:00.135
No, he is asking you to bring it.

00:31:01.395 --> 00:31:03.695
I should bring it to him? What
does it matter who takes it to him?

00:31:04.175 --> 00:31:05.005
I don't know.

00:31:05.165 --> 00:31:05.985
Here you go.

00:31:11.245 --> 00:31:13.045
I'll go and give him the file.
- Okay, Doctor.

00:31:15.705 --> 00:31:17.065
Excuse me, sir.
- Yeah...

00:31:17.955 --> 00:31:18.775
Come in.

00:31:19.705 --> 00:31:20.595
Come, Anitha.

00:31:21.325 --> 00:31:22.785
Tell me.
- Sir, here is the case file.

00:31:22.875 --> 00:31:23.715
Yeah.

00:31:25.395 --> 00:31:28.535
Sir, in this case, actually...
- Let it be. Please sit.

00:31:28.625 --> 00:31:30.545
It's okay, sir, no problem.
- Please sit..

00:31:31.575 --> 00:31:32.425
Thank you, sir.

00:31:36.555 --> 00:31:37.385
Okay.

00:31:38.815 --> 00:31:39.635
Anitha..

00:31:40.395 --> 00:31:43.525
Are you from this city
or have you moved here for work?

00:31:44.985 --> 00:31:46.925
I'm from this city, sir.
- Good.

00:31:48.655 --> 00:31:49.815
Which college did you study in?

00:31:51.075 --> 00:31:53.195
CMC, sir.
- CMC.

00:31:53.755 --> 00:31:55.005
Chennai Medical College.

00:31:57.035 --> 00:31:58.915
I know a little about Chennai.

00:31:59.455 --> 00:32:02.185
Though I'm a native of Hyderabad,
I've been here from time to time.

00:32:02.845 --> 00:32:04.155
Oh, okay.

00:32:05.275 --> 00:32:09.065
And.. How long have
you been working here?

00:32:10.255 --> 00:32:12.115
Just a few years, sir.
- Oh.

00:32:12.845 --> 00:32:14.005
Is your work going well?

00:32:15.265 --> 00:32:16.775
Yeah. It's going well, sir.

00:32:17.055 --> 00:32:18.525
Good, good.
- It's going well.

00:32:20.645 --> 00:32:22.405
Sir, in this case...
- So..

00:32:22.445 --> 00:32:23.765
No, no.
I'll take care of it.

00:32:27.305 --> 00:32:30.045
Are you married?

00:32:30.315 --> 00:32:32.545
Or do you have a boyfriend?

00:32:34.115 --> 00:32:34.955
No, sir.

00:32:35.655 --> 00:32:36.825
No? Okay.

00:32:40.495 --> 00:32:43.085
Sir, what happened
to the twins was...

00:32:43.285 --> 00:32:44.225
Look, Anitha.

00:32:44.465 --> 00:32:47.515
I should stay here for at least
three days to handle this case.

00:32:48.675 --> 00:32:50.785
I'll take care of all this.

00:32:51.545 --> 00:32:54.535
Actually, if you're free,

00:32:54.735 --> 00:32:59.505
can we go clubbing
or somewhere in the night?

00:32:59.615 --> 00:33:05.055
Today evening? It's been a long
time since I came to Chennai.

00:33:05.275 --> 00:33:07.705
And you said your native is here.

00:33:07.925 --> 00:33:08.905
So..

00:33:09.525 --> 00:33:11.215
I thought I'd ask you out.

00:33:13.695 --> 00:33:16.395
It's okay if you're not interested.
I'm not forcing you.

00:33:19.225 --> 00:33:20.095
Okay, Anitha.

00:33:22.015 --> 00:33:23.245
You get back to your work.

00:33:23.375 --> 00:33:24.805
Yeah, sir.
That would be better.

00:33:24.895 --> 00:33:26.575
Text me when you're free...
- Thank you...

00:33:26.715 --> 00:33:27.505
Bye.

00:33:34.135 --> 00:33:36.445
Senior, what did Dr. Raghav say?

00:33:37.675 --> 00:33:39.345
He was talking too much.

00:33:39.525 --> 00:33:41.925
'If I give some work to Anitha,
only she should do it.'

00:33:43.105 --> 00:33:45.535
He's overreacting.
So, what happened?

00:33:46.105 --> 00:33:48.055
He asked me
if I wanted to go clubbing.

00:33:48.145 --> 00:33:49.245
Hey, Anitha.

00:33:49.525 --> 00:33:51.165
Don't joke.
What happened?

00:33:51.815 --> 00:33:52.725
Leave way.

00:33:53.275 --> 00:33:55.325
What did you say
when he asked you that?

00:33:56.525 --> 00:33:57.885
I said I'll think about it.

00:34:04.335 --> 00:34:06.695
We take extra care of her at home.

00:34:06.745 --> 00:34:09.895
But I don't see any improvement
in her marks.

00:34:09.975 --> 00:34:15.385
No, sir. For the last term, I can
see improvement in Agalya's marks.

00:34:15.695 --> 00:34:17.885
Her performance is also improving.

00:34:18.385 --> 00:34:22.095
In fact, she's participating
in sports and drawing.

00:34:23.685 --> 00:34:24.525
Oh.

00:34:26.035 --> 00:34:27.725
Nice.
- But, sir...

00:34:28.355 --> 00:34:30.345
You haven't paid the term fees yet.

00:34:32.025 --> 00:34:35.055
We mentioned it
in your daughter's diary.

00:34:35.525 --> 00:34:38.525
We gave you a lot of
reminders from school.

00:34:38.655 --> 00:34:40.495
But you didn't
respond to any of them.

00:34:44.275 --> 00:34:46.855
Sir, it's been a long time
since you crossed the overdue date.

00:34:47.085 --> 00:34:49.775
We've already issued
the books for the next term.

00:34:49.865 --> 00:34:51.855
But, we didn't give it
to your daughter.

00:34:53.085 --> 00:34:55.465
They said they'll give it
only if you pay the fees.

00:34:58.365 --> 00:35:01.745
Okay, I'll pay it by this weekend.

00:35:02.555 --> 00:35:03.395
Okay.

00:35:04.995 --> 00:35:05.825
Thank you.

00:35:13.025 --> 00:35:15.145
'I don't know how you were before.'

00:35:15.515 --> 00:35:22.225
'But from now on, be sincere in your
work as if it was your company.'

00:35:23.495 --> 00:35:25.005
'I think you should start fresh.'

00:35:25.955 --> 00:35:26.815
'You can do it.'

00:35:27.705 --> 00:35:29.535
'Plus, we don't have
any other option.'

00:35:31.945 --> 00:35:37.305
'If you call Arjun,
I think he'll help you.'

00:35:51.215 --> 00:35:52.745
Hello.
- Hello, Arjun.

00:35:52.985 --> 00:35:53.815
Tell me, Madhan.

00:35:54.275 --> 00:35:55.425
Sorry to bother you.

00:35:55.975 --> 00:35:57.645
I didn't want to call you.

00:35:57.775 --> 00:36:00.345
But, my situation is like that.

00:36:01.365 --> 00:36:02.225
What happened?

00:36:04.535 --> 00:36:09.205
You helped me settle my loans
at the right time.

00:36:09.305 --> 00:36:15.155
But, my daughter's school fees
and household expenses are pending.

00:36:15.675 --> 00:36:17.425
I don't know what to do.

00:36:18.675 --> 00:36:20.055
How much do you want?
I'll send it.

00:36:20.135 --> 00:36:22.795
No, I didn't call you for money.

00:36:22.885 --> 00:36:24.705
I need a small favour.

00:36:27.555 --> 00:36:28.755
I called you again...

00:36:30.915 --> 00:36:36.975
I wanted to ask if I can join
as an employee at RK Hospital.

00:36:48.365 --> 00:36:52.025
Sorry, Arjun.
I didn't want to disturb you.

00:36:52.175 --> 00:36:54.995
I'm sorry.
I didn't know what to do.

00:36:55.375 --> 00:36:58.825
I called you as the last resort.

00:36:59.755 --> 00:37:00.575
No, Madhan.

00:37:00.735 --> 00:37:03.675
There are some problems here.
I'll think about it.

00:37:05.955 --> 00:37:10.465
Give me some time. I'll let you
know once the problems are settled.

00:37:11.565 --> 00:37:13.535
Yeah, sure.
Thank you.

00:37:26.365 --> 00:37:29.045
Amaya, your sister
is here to meet you.

00:37:30.415 --> 00:37:31.555
My sister?

00:37:34.705 --> 00:37:35.875
Why did she come here?

00:37:39.435 --> 00:37:41.175
Abhi, what are you doing here?

00:37:48.015 --> 00:37:49.075
What am I doing here?

00:37:49.345 --> 00:37:50.665
When was the last time
you came home?

00:37:52.265 --> 00:37:55.145
I'm not killing time here.
I have work to do, Abhi.

00:37:55.425 --> 00:37:57.765
Why don't you tell this
to someone else, Amaya?

00:37:57.855 --> 00:38:00.605
When you come home, you
have to look at me being jobless.

00:38:00.725 --> 00:38:03.195
You should deal with our father
who is a drunkard

00:38:03.275 --> 00:38:06.395
and our mother, who does nothing
but complain about the two of us.

00:38:06.465 --> 00:38:09.515
This job is the only way
for you to avoid all this.

00:38:10.505 --> 00:38:12.815
I'm not working here
just to avoid you guys.

00:38:13.055 --> 00:38:14.265
I'm doing this for you.

00:38:14.375 --> 00:38:17.425
Oh, dear, our grandma
died when we were born.

00:38:17.625 --> 00:38:18.475
Do you know why?

00:38:20.045 --> 00:38:21.205
Because you are here.

00:38:21.795 --> 00:38:23.755
She always point fingers
at everything we do.

00:38:25.425 --> 00:38:27.405
Look, I'm searching for a job.

00:38:27.835 --> 00:38:32.375
I can't work for a meagre salary
after completing engineering.

00:38:32.425 --> 00:38:33.275
Do you understand?

00:38:33.925 --> 00:38:36.105
No one asked you to go to work.

00:38:36.265 --> 00:38:37.795
Don't ruin my job, Abhi.

00:38:37.895 --> 00:38:39.915
I'm not here to ruin
your job, Amaya.

00:38:39.975 --> 00:38:43.465
We had borrowed Rs. 25,000
from our uncle, right?

00:38:43.535 --> 00:38:46.365
He came home and insulted us
for owing him that money.

00:38:46.415 --> 00:38:48.415
Our father was passed out as usual.

00:38:48.715 --> 00:38:50.875
Mom doesn't have any more
jewellery to pawn.

00:38:50.945 --> 00:38:52.985
You don't even answer my calls.

00:38:53.705 --> 00:38:56.735
I didn't get paid yet, Abhi.
I'll pay you when I get my salary.

00:38:56.875 --> 00:38:58.515
That's why I'm asking you
to answer the phone.

00:38:58.625 --> 00:39:00.305
If you do that,
why would I come here?

00:39:00.625 --> 00:39:04.345
Okay, I'll talk to our mother.
You leave from here first.

00:39:07.345 --> 00:39:09.425
You better answer the phone.
Do you understand?

00:39:10.515 --> 00:39:11.345
Abhi, one minute.

00:39:14.595 --> 00:39:15.315
Here.

00:39:19.215 --> 00:39:20.555
This is Rs. 3,000.

00:39:20.885 --> 00:39:22.795
I'll pay you the rest
when I get my salary.

00:39:22.955 --> 00:39:24.095
Give this to our mother.

00:39:24.955 --> 00:39:25.805
What?

00:39:27.235 --> 00:39:30.045
No, actually, I need Rs. 500.

00:39:31.615 --> 00:39:33.215
I need it to apply for a job.

00:39:38.795 --> 00:39:41.195
Wait till you get the job you want.

00:39:41.795 --> 00:39:43.655
I'll take care of things for now.

00:39:46.015 --> 00:39:48.085
Okay.
- Get the reports tomorrow. Bye.

00:39:48.205 --> 00:39:49.775
Okay, leave.
- What if he doesn't come?

00:39:51.635 --> 00:39:52.685
Hey, Amaya!

00:39:53.065 --> 00:39:54.055
Wow!
- Oh, no!

00:39:54.365 --> 00:39:55.425
What a change!

00:39:57.085 --> 00:39:59.765
You look more beautiful in this
dress than in the uniform.

00:39:59.925 --> 00:40:02.145
Superb... She looks more
beautiful than Reena.

00:40:02.235 --> 00:40:03.525
But, not as beautiful as Charu.

00:40:04.095 --> 00:40:05.515
Who is this madman?

00:40:05.985 --> 00:40:07.615
He is a doctor who works here.

00:40:07.945 --> 00:40:08.795
Doctor?

00:40:08.915 --> 00:40:09.745
Yes.

00:40:10.295 --> 00:40:11.725
He doesn't look like one.

00:40:13.495 --> 00:40:14.395
You leave now.

00:40:14.915 --> 00:40:16.295
Okay, I'll leave.

00:40:19.785 --> 00:40:23.425
Hi, Amritha, they'll bring
your babies here in some time.

00:40:23.755 --> 00:40:27.425
Their immunity power is low.
So, if they give you the babies now

00:40:27.555 --> 00:40:29.485
your body temperature...

00:40:30.005 --> 00:40:33.265
Your body temperature
and the babies' will be equal.

00:40:34.175 --> 00:40:36.685
That is why it is important
to give you the babies.

00:40:37.975 --> 00:40:39.945
As far as infection
control is concerned

00:40:39.975 --> 00:40:44.885
the nurses will explain
the details to you further.

00:40:44.975 --> 00:40:46.905
So, if you have any...

00:40:49.575 --> 00:40:52.555
Okay. They will clear
any further doubts you may have.

00:40:53.945 --> 00:40:56.755
And...
Don't worry about anything.

00:40:56.865 --> 00:40:58.425
Let the babies stabilize.

00:40:58.495 --> 00:41:00.485
Then we can start the surgery.

00:41:02.165 --> 00:41:08.445
And.. Our staff monitor
the babies 24 hours a day.

00:41:08.585 --> 00:41:09.945
So, don't worry.
Okay?

00:41:11.845 --> 00:41:12.725
Give me the report.

00:41:25.245 --> 00:41:28.385
Upload the current
analytics in the report. Okay?

00:41:28.745 --> 00:41:29.585
Okay, sir.

00:41:30.545 --> 00:41:31.375
Take care.

00:41:34.045 --> 00:41:34.865
Take care.

00:41:38.365 --> 00:41:39.325
Anitha.
- Sir?

00:41:39.805 --> 00:41:41.745
You communicated
well with the patient.

00:41:42.705 --> 00:41:43.555
Thank you, sir.

00:41:44.145 --> 00:41:47.715
And.. Think about what I asked you.

00:41:49.905 --> 00:41:51.555
I'll think about it, sir.

00:41:52.005 --> 00:41:53.555
Now, I'll leave.
- Okay, sure.

00:41:55.675 --> 00:41:56.595
Mr. Raghav.

00:41:59.035 --> 00:42:01.305
You go ahead, Anitha.
I need to talk to him.

00:42:04.065 --> 00:42:04.935
Tell me, sir.

00:42:06.225 --> 00:42:07.425
You have to tell me, sir.

00:42:07.875 --> 00:42:09.885
Is everything comfortable here?

00:42:10.275 --> 00:42:12.255
And.. How is the work going?

00:42:15.005 --> 00:42:17.345
What is this, sir?
Are you getting angry?

00:42:18.255 --> 00:42:21.965
Why? Don't you like it
when boys touch you?

00:42:22.875 --> 00:42:27.505
Hey! Do you think I don't know
what you are doing?

00:42:28.835 --> 00:42:31.505
Just focus on what
you are here for.

00:42:31.985 --> 00:42:36.055
Concentrate on that.
Don't think about anything else.

00:42:36.695 --> 00:42:41.095
I know what you are doing
and what you are trying to do.

00:42:42.055 --> 00:42:42.935
I'm watching you.

00:42:43.435 --> 00:42:45.885
I don't care what you do out there.
But here...

00:42:46.575 --> 00:42:49.925
In my hospital, behave properly.

00:42:50.775 --> 00:42:52.235
Stay away from Anitha.

00:42:54.195 --> 00:42:55.045
And...

00:42:55.395 --> 00:42:58.895
If this happens again...
I won't be talking to you.

00:42:59.495 --> 00:43:02.285
Dr. Raghav.
Do you understand?

00:43:02.585 --> 00:43:03.775
Yes, I do.

00:43:16.525 --> 00:43:17.365
What.

00:43:18.825 --> 00:43:19.695
Nothing.

00:43:20.585 --> 00:43:21.435
Go.

00:44:28.918 --> 00:44:31.918
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

00:44:34.028 --> 00:44:36.548
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

00:44:39.018 --> 00:44:42.058
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

00:44:43.718 --> 00:44:46.068
♪ Our patience wins ♪

00:44:46.188 --> 00:44:48.738
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

00:44:48.788 --> 00:44:51.658
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

00:44:51.678 --> 00:44:53.948
♪ I am a doctor ♪

00:44:56.408 --> 00:44:59.318
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

00:45:01.488 --> 00:45:04.028
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

00:45:05.978 --> 00:45:10.498
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

00:45:32.698 --> 00:45:33.688
What did you do with Raghav?

00:45:35.318 --> 00:45:37.248
Nothing.
I just spoke to him.

00:45:37.568 --> 00:45:38.588
What did you tell him?

00:45:41.578 --> 00:45:43.898
I told him that he is here for
a surgery with Dr. Preetham.

00:45:44.198 --> 00:45:45.858
and to mind his business.

00:45:48.628 --> 00:45:52.438
So, you didn't talk to him about
how he behaved with me, right?

00:45:54.318 --> 00:45:56.888
I am the CEO of this hospital.
So, I did what I had to do.

00:45:57.678 --> 00:46:00.858
It is my responsibility
to keep the hospital staff safe.

00:46:00.928 --> 00:46:04.188
Did I tell you that I didn't feel
safe when he was around?

00:46:04.228 --> 00:46:05.558
That's what I am also asking.

00:46:06.228 --> 00:46:09.228
Why didn't you come to me
and tell me about his behaviour?

00:46:09.858 --> 00:46:13.718
Do you think that I have never
faced someone like Raghav?

00:46:13.898 --> 00:46:15.828
Or do you think
that I can't handle him?

00:46:16.528 --> 00:46:20.198
All the women who work
face someone like him daily.

00:46:20.408 --> 00:46:22.098
They all know their limits.

00:46:22.578 --> 00:46:25.118
They can handle themselves, okay?

00:46:25.358 --> 00:46:28.238
So, you are asking me
to leave it be?

00:46:29.618 --> 00:46:31.198
Is he torturing you
because of what I said?

00:46:31.438 --> 00:46:32.298
Torture?

00:46:32.498 --> 00:46:34.188
He ran away
because of what you did.

00:46:34.718 --> 00:46:36.378
He switched off his phone.

00:46:37.548 --> 00:46:38.968
The surgery is going to start soon.

00:46:39.008 --> 00:46:40.448
How will you manage
without the chief doctor?

00:46:47.058 --> 00:46:48.358
You prepare for the surgery.

00:46:50.848 --> 00:46:52.358
I will arrange a good surgeon soon.

00:46:52.758 --> 00:46:55.598
Whatever it is, do it soon.
We don't have much time.

00:47:20.508 --> 00:47:23.308
Where are you going?
I am here to talk to you.

00:47:23.558 --> 00:47:25.988
No, Doctor.
I am getting late for my duty.

00:47:26.558 --> 00:47:28.738
Sit down.
You are always busy with your duties.

00:47:32.188 --> 00:47:33.248
Tell me, Doctor.

00:47:33.858 --> 00:47:36.798
Nothing.
I have been observing you.

00:47:36.898 --> 00:47:38.368
You come before your duty time.

00:47:38.418 --> 00:47:39.798
And you do your work.

00:47:39.848 --> 00:47:43.048
Even after your work, you work
for others without complaining.

00:47:43.328 --> 00:47:45.118
How can you survive like this?

00:47:45.658 --> 00:47:46.598
No, Doctor.

00:47:47.368 --> 00:47:48.908
I am used to it.

00:47:50.248 --> 00:47:53.608
You are always busy with your
work. No one thinks about you.

00:47:54.168 --> 00:47:56.318
They will just give you more work.

00:47:57.418 --> 00:47:58.328
It's okay, Doctor.

00:48:01.428 --> 00:48:04.478
The reason why I'm asking is..
I am also like you.

00:48:04.598 --> 00:48:08.358
These guys are already ordering me
around, despite my age.

00:48:09.018 --> 00:48:11.908
I don't know for how long
I am going to listen to him.

00:48:12.648 --> 00:48:14.568
But, how you are like this?

00:48:14.938 --> 00:48:15.998
No, Doctor.

00:48:16.108 --> 00:48:18.708
I usually don't talk much.

00:48:19.738 --> 00:48:24.238
If you are not a talker, you listen
to people who talk well. Correct?

00:48:25.238 --> 00:48:25.988
I need your help.

00:48:26.278 --> 00:48:27.138
Tell me, Doctor.

00:48:27.788 --> 00:48:30.688
I don't know whom I can talk to.

00:48:31.038 --> 00:48:32.988
I will go mad
if I don't talk to anyone.

00:48:33.828 --> 00:48:37.268
Shall I vent out my stress to you
about their torture of me?

00:48:41.938 --> 00:48:42.768
Thank you.

00:48:44.588 --> 00:48:46.388
Doctor, I have a doubt.

00:48:46.558 --> 00:48:49.188
Your accent is very unique.
Where are you from?

00:48:49.388 --> 00:48:50.448
I am from Tirunelveli.

00:48:50.808 --> 00:48:52.878
It's been a long time
since I came here.

00:48:52.928 --> 00:48:54.808
But I'm unable to change my accent.

00:48:54.938 --> 00:48:58.878
If someone talks to me for
a few days, they will talk like me.

00:48:58.978 --> 00:49:00.908
But my accent remains the same.

00:49:01.398 --> 00:49:03.008
I have a doubt for a long time.

00:49:03.818 --> 00:49:07.128
Maybe, they have already kept me
aside due to my age.

00:49:07.418 --> 00:49:09.658
And it's obvious that I am from
Tirunelveli because of my accent.

00:49:09.698 --> 00:49:12.948
So I wonder if they look down
upon me because of my native place.

00:49:13.368 --> 00:49:14.318
No, no.

00:49:14.878 --> 00:49:16.068
It's not like that, Doctor.

00:49:16.168 --> 00:49:17.478
Oh, you don't know that.

00:49:17.598 --> 00:49:21.118
You don't know about Rocky.
He talks a lot.

00:49:21.258 --> 00:49:23.588
One day,
I will take his curly hair and..

00:49:28.278 --> 00:49:31.568
Okay, Doctor. I am getting
late for my duty. I will leave.

00:49:31.658 --> 00:49:33.858
You don't have to call me doctor.

00:49:34.018 --> 00:49:36.158
You can call me by my name.

00:49:36.608 --> 00:49:39.218
But you don't like disrespect.

00:49:39.318 --> 00:49:41.108
That's for other people.

00:49:41.338 --> 00:49:43.108
You can call me by my name.

00:49:44.858 --> 00:49:45.948
Okay, Doctor.

00:49:52.198 --> 00:49:53.518
Hey..
- Hey..

00:49:53.538 --> 00:49:54.658
Oh, no!
- Don't you have sense?

00:49:56.418 --> 00:49:58.348
Oh, no, I'm so sorry.

00:49:58.498 --> 00:50:00.848
I couldn't control myself
because of your sudden brake.

00:50:01.048 --> 00:50:03.568
Did you get hurt?
- Why did you drive like this?

00:50:03.728 --> 00:50:04.838
Can't you be more careful?

00:50:06.628 --> 00:50:08.358
The bike won't start.

00:50:12.198 --> 00:50:13.048
You hit me, right?

00:50:13.098 --> 00:50:15.948
Give me the money to repair it.
Or I won't let you go.

00:50:16.228 --> 00:50:17.558
Hey, Teju.
It's me.

00:50:21.238 --> 00:50:22.158
Oh, it's you.

00:50:23.488 --> 00:50:25.908
Anyway, pay me for the repairs.

00:50:27.908 --> 00:50:28.858
Why should I give you money?

00:50:29.198 --> 00:50:30.908
I hit you because
of your sudden brake.

00:50:31.358 --> 00:50:34.278
Hey, idiot. Why didn't you hit
the brakes when you were turning?

00:50:34.998 --> 00:50:37.008
Look, Teju. Your bike will stop
if you hit the brakes.

00:50:37.048 --> 00:50:38.038
My bike is not like that.

00:50:40.048 --> 00:50:42.048
Now, what?
Are you blaming me?

00:50:43.048 --> 00:50:43.958
Great if you understand.

00:50:44.798 --> 00:50:47.698
Look here.
You better get my bike repaired.

00:50:48.158 --> 00:50:50.658
Or I won't leave you alone.
- What do you mean?

00:50:51.238 --> 00:50:53.358
I wanted to talk to you
as a friend.

00:50:53.428 --> 00:50:54.348
Oh!

00:50:54.598 --> 00:50:56.008
Are you talking to me as a friend?

00:50:56.178 --> 00:50:59.478
Of course. It's been so long
and I wanted to know how you are.

00:50:59.938 --> 00:51:01.098
But you are fighting with me.

00:51:02.738 --> 00:51:03.528
Oh, really?

00:51:03.988 --> 00:51:05.958
After you kicked me
out of the hospital

00:51:06.028 --> 00:51:08.998
no one called me to check up on me.

00:51:09.158 --> 00:51:10.688
And you're concerned
all of a sudden?

00:51:10.828 --> 00:51:12.678
Was what you did
in the hospital right, Teju?

00:51:13.048 --> 00:51:13.988
Did you see it?

00:51:14.998 --> 00:51:16.078
I asked you if you saw it.

00:51:18.988 --> 00:51:20.048
Okay, don't start again.

00:51:20.188 --> 00:51:21.908
I don't want
your concern or attention.

00:51:22.248 --> 00:51:24.668
Come on, get my bike repaired.
I have a lot of work.

00:51:25.408 --> 00:51:27.408
Why are you staring at me?
Start the bike.

00:51:29.238 --> 00:51:30.478
Hey, Nilofer.
- Yes.

00:51:31.088 --> 00:51:33.478
I heard that they are looking
for a replacement for Dr. Raghav.

00:51:33.808 --> 00:51:34.708
Why? What happened?

00:51:34.808 --> 00:51:37.148
He left yesterday.
He didn't come back in the morning.

00:51:37.518 --> 00:51:38.738
His phone is also not reachable.

00:51:39.098 --> 00:51:40.738
They are saying
that he has absconded.

00:51:41.268 --> 00:51:44.188
Why? Did he leave because he
couldn't handle the difficult case?

00:51:44.228 --> 00:51:47.358
No. Not that. They are saying
it's because of Anitha.

00:51:49.818 --> 00:51:52.078
Why? What did she do?

00:51:53.488 --> 00:51:57.038
Yesterday, Dr. Raghav tried
to misbehave with Anitha.

00:51:57.118 --> 00:51:58.878
That's why,
Mr. Arjun gave him a warning.

00:51:58.998 --> 00:52:00.448
That's when he left.
He hasn't come back yet.

00:52:01.078 --> 00:52:02.388
Don't gossip unnecessarily.

00:52:02.498 --> 00:52:04.288
Guna, I am not gossiping.

00:52:04.418 --> 00:52:08.408
That's why, Anitha asked
Mr. Arjun to arrange a new doctor.

00:52:10.048 --> 00:52:12.668
Hey, yes. I saw her coming
out of Mr. Arjun's office.

00:52:13.008 --> 00:52:13.848
I saw it.

00:52:28.318 --> 00:52:29.148
Dude.

00:52:29.568 --> 00:52:30.408
Dude?

00:52:32.988 --> 00:52:33.828
Oh, no!

00:52:34.618 --> 00:52:35.478
Reena, dude.

00:52:37.238 --> 00:52:39.058
He is Dr. Radhi's son, right?
- Yes.

00:52:41.968 --> 00:52:44.298
Reena, dude.
Dude!

00:52:49.128 --> 00:52:52.068
What, dude?
You are pretending not to hear me.

00:52:52.588 --> 00:52:53.838
You are not talking to me.

00:52:54.098 --> 00:52:56.518
I don't understand
what is happening in my house.

00:52:56.808 --> 00:52:59.368
Everyone is behaving differently.

00:53:00.768 --> 00:53:03.348
We were so happy a few days back.

00:53:04.108 --> 00:53:07.098
We sneaked and ate snacks
without mom's knowledge.

00:53:07.958 --> 00:53:11.818
You helped me
join the football team.

00:53:12.198 --> 00:53:15.838
Because of you,
I am playing in the team happily.

00:53:18.538 --> 00:53:20.528
Okay.
You go and play now.

00:53:20.998 --> 00:53:23.028
If your mom knows that you
are talking to me, she'll lose it.

00:53:23.578 --> 00:53:25.398
That's true, dude.

00:53:25.938 --> 00:53:30.558
After the fight at home,
Divi told me not to talk to you.

00:53:31.378 --> 00:53:32.198
Why did she say that?

00:53:32.758 --> 00:53:35.128
You are also mom's daughter, right?

00:53:38.138 --> 00:53:40.518
Then, you are also
my sister like Divi.

00:53:42.978 --> 00:53:44.768
Okay, finish your game and go home.

00:53:45.228 --> 00:53:46.378
I will talk to you later.

00:53:46.938 --> 00:53:48.618
Dude, bye, Sister.
- Bye.

00:53:57.488 --> 00:54:00.228
Hey, did Raghav misbehave with you?

00:54:04.078 --> 00:54:05.518
Why didn't you tell me?

00:54:07.038 --> 00:54:09.418
Are you trying to be superior?

00:54:11.508 --> 00:54:14.268
I have told you so many
times to talk to me politely.

00:54:15.128 --> 00:54:16.148
Talk to me politely.

00:54:17.968 --> 00:54:20.558
You have told Arjun.
Don't you want to tell me?

00:54:20.768 --> 00:54:24.438
I didn't tell Arjun. He found out
somehow and warned Raghav.

00:54:28.018 --> 00:54:29.688
Why should I tell you all this?

00:54:31.188 --> 00:54:34.338
First of all,
stop making this an issue.

00:54:34.768 --> 00:54:35.908
I know how to take care of myself.

00:54:36.858 --> 00:54:40.358
Change your mindset that expects me
to report to you with my problems.

00:54:40.778 --> 00:54:42.838
If I need any help,
I will come and ask for it.

00:54:44.248 --> 00:54:46.168
I can't keep reporting
everything to you.

00:54:48.208 --> 00:54:50.338
Everyone needs a personal space.

00:54:50.628 --> 00:54:52.138
It should be given.

00:54:52.668 --> 00:54:54.398
Try to understand this first.

00:54:55.088 --> 00:54:57.038
Don't react for everything.

00:55:09.618 --> 00:55:11.398
Hey, when did you come here?

00:55:12.528 --> 00:55:14.158
I've been here since
before you walked in.

00:55:16.068 --> 00:55:20.258
Dude, it's nothing. It's just
a fight between senior and junior.

00:55:20.618 --> 00:55:24.858
Oh. I thought it was a fight
between a husband and wife.

00:55:26.828 --> 00:55:27.688
No, no, no.

00:55:27.958 --> 00:55:32.688
It looked like a fight
between secret lovers.

00:55:33.298 --> 00:55:34.718
Dude, it's not like that.

00:55:35.248 --> 00:55:37.908
I just wanted to check up on the
senior since there is a problem.

00:55:38.088 --> 00:55:41.018
Anyway I sent you
the details of the house.

00:55:41.218 --> 00:55:43.018
What happened?
- You are handling it horribly.

00:55:43.348 --> 00:55:45.178
I saw it.
But, I don't like it.

00:55:45.768 --> 00:55:46.578
Why?

00:55:47.138 --> 00:55:49.568
The facilities are good.
It's semi-furnished.

00:55:49.968 --> 00:55:51.798
The hospital is nearby.

00:55:51.978 --> 00:55:54.818
It's there. But, nothing is
there in your building.

00:55:56.738 --> 00:55:58.528
I want a house in your building.

00:55:59.158 --> 00:56:00.068
Okay.

00:56:00.358 --> 00:56:02.658
I will see if there is any
vacant house in my building.

00:56:07.458 --> 00:56:08.568
'What if it's true?'

00:56:09.538 --> 00:56:12.088
'No. Guna is a good guy.
It won't be true.'

00:56:13.378 --> 00:56:14.208
Sir.

00:56:14.998 --> 00:56:15.858
Come.

00:56:17.088 --> 00:56:19.488
Sir, I got the X-ray
of twin babies.

00:56:19.538 --> 00:56:20.398
Thanks, dear.

00:56:43.528 --> 00:56:44.608
This is pneumonia.

00:56:54.208 --> 00:56:56.268
Arjun, did you get
the surgeon's contact?

00:56:57.128 --> 00:56:59.258
I am looking into it.
I will arrange it soon.

00:56:59.478 --> 00:57:03.018
There is no time, Arjun.
The heart donor baby has pneumonia.

00:57:03.388 --> 00:57:05.528
The lungs are fully inflamed.
We need to do something, Arjun.

00:57:05.928 --> 00:57:06.748
Find someone.

00:57:08.448 --> 00:57:09.558
I will figure out something, sir.

00:57:10.558 --> 00:57:12.128
I will arrange a doctor soon.

00:57:14.518 --> 00:57:15.338
Right.

00:57:32.538 --> 00:57:33.868
Hello.
Tell me, Aruna.

00:57:34.038 --> 00:57:36.548
Reena, where are you?
Aren't you at the hospital yet?

00:57:38.528 --> 00:57:41.278
There was a problem with the bike
on the way. Tell me, what happened?

00:57:41.458 --> 00:57:44.378
The condition of the babies
has become critical, Reena.

00:57:44.928 --> 00:57:46.258
Why didn't they do the surgery yet?

00:57:46.678 --> 00:57:49.528
Dr. Raghav is not here.
He has left.

00:57:50.468 --> 00:57:52.558
He left..
Then, who will do the surgery?

00:57:53.228 --> 00:57:55.708
He has left, Reena. I can't tell
you everything over the phone.

00:57:55.938 --> 00:57:56.788
Come in person.

00:57:57.808 --> 00:58:00.408
I have already told them
to ask Dr. Radhi.

00:58:00.938 --> 00:58:02.668
But Arjun doesn't seem
to accept it.

00:58:02.858 --> 00:58:03.698
Aruna!

00:58:05.158 --> 00:58:07.878
Okay. Come soon.
Dr. Preetham is calling me.

00:58:08.578 --> 00:58:10.408
Okay, I will come in 10 minutes.

00:58:18.318 --> 00:58:20.868
There is an emergency
in the hospital. I have to go now.

00:58:32.228 --> 00:58:33.378
I was angry with you.

00:58:34.428 --> 00:58:36.688
But I am very happy to see you now.

00:58:39.018 --> 00:58:39.848
Bye.

00:58:55.328 --> 00:58:56.408
'Arjun is an alcoholic.'

00:58:57.378 --> 00:58:59.328
'I have seen him drunk
in many places.'

00:58:59.708 --> 00:59:02.228
'In the canteen,
parking lots and hotels.'

00:59:02.668 --> 00:59:06.248
'Ma'am, this is your limit.'

00:59:06.458 --> 00:59:07.818
'I should speak the truth, Arjun.'

00:59:08.298 --> 00:59:09.798
'You don't drink today, it's okay.'

00:59:10.258 --> 00:59:11.718
'But if you come drunk
to the hospital tomorrow'

00:59:11.758 --> 00:59:13.408
'what will happen?'

00:59:13.468 --> 00:59:15.548
'I told you that she doesn't have
a basic human quality.'

00:59:15.768 --> 00:59:18.128
'She gave birth when she was
14 years old.. - Arjun!'

00:59:18.648 --> 00:59:19.558
'Ask her to try denying it.'

00:59:19.758 --> 00:59:22.458
'Ask her to try denying the fact
that Dr. Reena is her daughter.'

00:59:29.878 --> 00:59:30.738
Arjun.

00:59:31.448 --> 00:59:32.638
Come in.
Why are you standing there?

00:59:35.868 --> 00:59:36.718
Come, Arjun.

00:59:41.248 --> 00:59:42.998
How are you?
- I am fine, sir.

00:59:43.198 --> 00:59:44.398
Is everything fine?
- I am fine, sir. How are you?

00:59:45.118 --> 00:59:46.398
How is your work?

00:59:47.258 --> 00:59:48.108
All good, sir.

00:59:48.468 --> 00:59:49.338
What would you have?

00:59:49.388 --> 00:59:50.698
I don't want anything, sir.

00:59:51.738 --> 00:59:53.278
I came to talk to Dr. Radhi.

00:59:54.388 --> 00:59:55.288
Okay, go ahead.

01:00:15.868 --> 01:00:17.168
Why are you here now, Arjun?

01:00:18.868 --> 01:00:21.118
There is a complicated case
in the hospital, ma'am.

01:00:32.568 --> 01:00:36.148
Ma'am, this is a case of a three
zygotic conjoined parasitic twins.

01:00:36.558 --> 01:00:39.328
One baby's kidney function
is very weak.

01:00:39.668 --> 01:00:41.768
The other baby's heart
is not fully developed.

01:00:41.888 --> 01:00:43.438
But, all the other
organs are stable.

01:00:44.858 --> 01:00:46.478
Based on our analysis

01:00:47.528 --> 01:00:49.858
the survival rate of the first
baby is less than 10%.

01:00:50.398 --> 01:00:51.238
So..

01:00:51.738 --> 01:00:55.368
we've decided to transplant the
first baby's heart to the second.

01:00:58.408 --> 01:01:02.218
When there was a need
for another surgeon for this case

01:01:03.078 --> 01:01:05.858
you were everyone's first choice.

01:01:06.498 --> 01:01:07.378
Not just that..

01:01:08.508 --> 01:01:09.648
You are my first choice as well.

01:01:12.088 --> 01:01:12.938
But..

01:01:14.138 --> 01:01:17.078
I didn't know how to meet you
and put forward this request.

01:01:19.428 --> 01:01:21.648
I wanted to finish this case
with someone else. But..

01:01:22.958 --> 01:01:23.848
It didn't work out.

01:01:24.808 --> 01:01:26.628
And in the last minute

01:01:26.778 --> 01:01:30.818
you know how difficult it is to get
another surgeon's appointment.

01:01:32.468 --> 01:01:33.348
So..

01:01:37.158 --> 01:01:40.258
If you come to the hospital
and finish this surgery

01:01:40.468 --> 01:01:41.668
it will be very helpful.

01:01:44.458 --> 01:01:45.398
How, Arjun?

01:01:46.078 --> 01:01:48.888
How can I come and work
again after so many problems?

01:01:49.878 --> 01:01:51.658
How can I focus on the surgery?

01:01:52.298 --> 01:01:54.748
And after all that
you have done to me

01:01:55.548 --> 01:01:57.338
do you really expect me
to just come back?

01:02:00.348 --> 01:02:01.458
What I did was wrong.

01:02:01.688 --> 01:02:02.868
And, I am sorry for that.

01:02:05.268 --> 01:02:07.508
Instead of thinking
about our problems

01:02:07.728 --> 01:02:09.148
we should save a child's life.

01:02:09.458 --> 01:02:10.278
That is important.

01:02:10.578 --> 01:02:12.958
And, I know that
you will think the same.

01:02:14.718 --> 01:02:17.338
So, please put your anger aside

01:02:18.428 --> 01:02:19.568
and come and help me.

01:02:23.178 --> 01:02:25.998
You have run the hospital
without me for a month.

01:02:26.368 --> 01:02:28.968
As a CEO,
you must know many doctors.

01:02:29.348 --> 01:02:31.218
You must have the contact
details of other CEOs.

01:02:32.258 --> 01:02:34.808
Despite having so many resources,
why are you calling me back, Arjun?

01:02:35.588 --> 01:02:37.548
Ma'am, I've tried everything
that you told me.

01:02:38.008 --> 01:02:40.538
But, at this time,
no one is ready to come.

01:02:41.258 --> 01:02:44.338
So, at least come
to the hospital as a freelancer

01:02:44.768 --> 01:02:45.868
and do this surgery for us.

01:02:47.478 --> 01:02:48.398
Please.

01:02:51.358 --> 01:02:52.858
Don't waste your time, Arjun.

01:02:53.068 --> 01:02:54.678
I will never come back.

01:02:55.358 --> 01:02:57.668
Go and arrange for another doctor.

01:03:13.958 --> 01:03:17.008
I asked for help
from the other doctors as a CEO.

01:03:19.258 --> 01:03:22.168
But, I came to you
asking it as a personal help.

01:03:23.508 --> 01:03:26.538
The success rate
of this surgery is very low.

01:03:27.058 --> 01:03:30.908
But, the donor child
is affected with pneumonia.

01:03:35.608 --> 01:03:37.208
We don't have much time.

01:03:38.108 --> 01:03:40.448
no one but you
can deal with this case.

01:03:41.198 --> 01:03:44.868
I have faith that only you can
complete this case successfully.

01:03:46.448 --> 01:03:47.278
So..

01:03:48.038 --> 01:03:51.908
just think about
what I told you once.

01:05:08.073 --> 01:05:10.993
♪ Listen to the heart ♪

01:05:13.103 --> 01:05:15.743
♪ It beats lub-dub ♪

01:05:18.193 --> 01:05:21.323
♪ Even when patients panic ♪

01:05:23.013 --> 01:05:25.273
♪ Our patience wins ♪

01:05:25.613 --> 01:05:27.923
♪ Our duty is fun-filled ♪

01:05:28.243 --> 01:05:30.773
♪ Every day miracles occur ♪

01:05:30.953 --> 01:05:33.523
♪ I am a doctor ♪

01:05:35.693 --> 01:05:38.443
♪ I'm a two-legged booster ♪

01:05:40.693 --> 01:05:43.443
♪ Life is a theatre ♪

01:05:45.323 --> 01:05:49.513
♪ In it, I'm a doctor ♪

01:06:05.713 --> 01:06:07.153
Doctor.
Doctor.

01:06:07.553 --> 01:06:11.133
Please allow me to see my children
before the surgery. Please, Doctor.

01:06:11.223 --> 01:06:15.443
Sir.. The conditions of both
the children are a bit complicated.

01:06:16.223 --> 01:06:17.443
They have pneumonia on top of that.

01:06:17.983 --> 01:06:21.773
So, the surgery has to be started
sooner than already scheduled.

01:06:22.683 --> 01:06:25.733
So, you can't see the children now.
Sorry, sir.

01:06:27.263 --> 01:06:30.413
What happened to my
children, Doctor? Tell me, Doctor.

01:06:30.793 --> 01:06:31.623
Sir.

01:06:31.903 --> 01:06:32.893
Please.

01:06:33.033 --> 01:06:35.323
Sorry.
Sorry, Doctor.

01:06:35.903 --> 01:06:36.753
Sorry..

01:06:37.533 --> 01:06:38.363
Doctor.

01:06:39.813 --> 01:06:41.733
First, you said that you
will save both my children.

01:06:43.103 --> 01:06:44.673
Then, you said that
a child doesn't have a heart.

01:06:45.763 --> 01:06:47.423
and that you can save
only one child.

01:06:48.643 --> 01:06:51.283
I've been waiting here,
battling my anxiety.

01:06:51.653 --> 01:06:53.863
But you are saying that I can't see
both the children now.

01:06:54.103 --> 01:06:55.743
You are not even
showing my children to me.

01:06:56.013 --> 01:06:58.083
Do something, Doctor, please.

01:06:58.303 --> 01:07:00.593
Sir, the chief doctor and the CEO

01:07:00.703 --> 01:07:04.003
are trying to get an appointment
with an experienced surgeon.

01:07:04.223 --> 01:07:06.073
They will surely arrange it soon.

01:07:06.483 --> 01:07:09.123
Once they make the arrangements,
we will start the surgery.

01:07:09.753 --> 01:07:12.353
Until then,
please don't lose heart, sir.

01:07:12.423 --> 01:07:14.013
I don't know what to do, Doctor.
- Doctor.

01:07:14.493 --> 01:07:15.913
Dr. Preetham called for you.

01:07:19.423 --> 01:07:21.783
Sir, please understand, sorry.

01:07:22.253 --> 01:07:23.083
Doctor..

01:07:28.623 --> 01:07:30.153
I asked you to talk to Dr. Suresh.
Did you talk to him? - Sir..

01:07:30.863 --> 01:07:32.083
Did you get the surgeon?

01:07:33.903 --> 01:07:37.203
I've tried asking other
hospital CEOs in my contact list.

01:07:37.483 --> 01:07:39.083
Most of the surgeons are busy.

01:07:39.523 --> 01:07:41.923
Some of them are afraid
that their reputation

01:07:41.973 --> 01:07:44.143
will be ruined since
the success rate is low.

01:07:44.543 --> 01:07:45.503
What about Dr. Radhi?

01:07:45.793 --> 01:07:47.043
We can ask her.

01:07:47.363 --> 01:07:49.373
She will surely help us
with this case.

01:07:50.853 --> 01:07:52.063
I am coming from her house now.

01:07:52.593 --> 01:07:54.213
I asked her many times.

01:07:55.033 --> 01:07:56.693
I told her
all the details of this case.

01:07:57.253 --> 01:07:59.903
But, I don't think she will come.

01:08:00.713 --> 01:08:02.383
Sir, but without
another senior surgeon

01:08:02.433 --> 01:08:04.323
we can't complete this
successfully.

01:08:11.103 --> 01:08:11.923
Guys..

01:08:13.863 --> 01:08:15.283
We have no choice.

01:08:15.753 --> 01:08:18.283
We can't save their lives
if we don't do the surgery.

01:08:19.183 --> 01:08:20.993
So, let's proceed with the surgeon.

01:08:21.753 --> 01:08:24.113
But, sir.
Who will do the surgery?

01:08:27.283 --> 01:08:28.403
I will lead the surgery.

01:08:28.883 --> 01:08:30.413
Anitha will be my second hand.

01:08:30.913 --> 01:08:32.443
She has a lot
of experience in this.

01:08:32.773 --> 01:08:35.413
Naveen and Reena will help us.

01:08:41.833 --> 01:08:44.733
Guys, there is no need to panic.

01:08:45.893 --> 01:08:47.493
We will give our best efforts.

01:08:48.293 --> 01:08:50.593
We can definitely save their lives.

01:08:51.073 --> 01:08:52.733
Let's do this.

01:08:53.963 --> 01:08:55.853
Yes, sir. I will give my best.
- Yes?

01:08:57.353 --> 01:08:59.383
Yes, sir.
- Okay..

01:09:00.213 --> 01:09:01.443
Get everything ready
for the surgery.

01:09:01.593 --> 01:09:04.283
And one of you inform
Naveen immediately.

01:09:04.643 --> 01:09:06.393
Yeah?
- Sure, sir.

01:09:06.723 --> 01:09:07.573
Yeah.

01:10:13.993 --> 01:10:14.843
Radhi.

01:10:23.193 --> 01:10:24.203
What are you doing?

01:10:27.333 --> 01:10:28.603
Why? What's wrong?

01:10:29.573 --> 01:10:31.413
Did I ask you
not to go to the hospital?

01:10:32.443 --> 01:10:35.233
You didn't say anything.
It is my decision.

01:10:36.363 --> 01:10:37.373
I am asking you why.

01:10:39.783 --> 01:10:42.213
To spend time with our kids.

01:10:42.473 --> 01:10:43.773
Why are you doing this now?

01:10:45.423 --> 01:10:47.613
You went to the hospital just
a few months after Sid was born.

01:10:48.793 --> 01:10:52.013
You wouldn't have felt like
taking a break from the hospital.

01:10:54.333 --> 01:10:55.993
I know why you are doing this.

01:10:56.563 --> 01:10:58.033
You want me to feel better, right?

01:10:59.623 --> 01:11:01.403
Nothing is going to change
no matter what you do.

01:11:02.843 --> 01:11:05.243
It's not what you think, Dev.

01:11:05.383 --> 01:11:06.233
Then, what is it?

01:11:07.363 --> 01:11:11.393
Have I ever stopped you from
doing anything after our marriage?

01:11:12.363 --> 01:11:13.233
N-No.

01:11:15.323 --> 01:11:19.493
Whether I'm talking to you or not,
I won't ask you to change for me.

01:11:19.923 --> 01:11:21.043
You know that.

01:11:22.343 --> 01:11:25.773
Even if we are not together,
I won't expect you to change.

01:11:27.433 --> 01:11:29.053
Don't expect me to change my mind

01:11:29.223 --> 01:11:30.763
just because
you don't go to the hospital.

01:12:56.883 --> 01:12:57.843
Hey, Radhi.

01:12:59.863 --> 01:13:02.483
What are you thinking about,
all alone?

01:13:05.853 --> 01:13:07.693
I don't know what to do, Divi.

01:13:07.953 --> 01:13:09.563
I am confused.

01:13:10.003 --> 01:13:12.473
Dad himself asked you
to go to the hospital.

01:13:12.723 --> 01:13:14.073
Then, why are you confused?

01:13:14.263 --> 01:13:16.223
Why are you avoiding the hospital?

01:13:19.473 --> 01:13:21.233
I don't know.
It just occurred to me.

01:13:22.123 --> 01:13:24.783
You took me to my swimming class
the other day, right?

01:13:25.003 --> 01:13:27.303
Did you feel that you
should take me home

01:13:27.433 --> 01:13:30.543
after what happened
to that old man?

01:13:31.093 --> 01:13:32.233
No, right?

01:13:32.763 --> 01:13:35.663
You were only thinking
about saving that old man, right?

01:13:36.313 --> 01:13:38.133
The situation was different
that day, Divi.

01:13:38.633 --> 01:13:40.443
That old man needed our help.

01:13:40.963 --> 01:13:45.473
And, how can we leave a person
who is struggling for his life?

01:13:45.983 --> 01:13:49.633
So why didn't the others
think like that?

01:13:50.903 --> 01:13:55.583
So many people were there. But only
you wanted to save him, right?

01:13:55.993 --> 01:14:00.723
Because you were a doctor there.
Do you know how good it was?

01:14:03.013 --> 01:14:06.903
It felt like I saw you as a doctor
after a long time.

01:14:07.213 --> 01:14:09.453
I liked that a lot.

01:14:09.613 --> 01:14:11.073
Because that's you.

01:14:11.473 --> 01:14:14.343
You can't change that,
no matter what you do.

01:14:20.103 --> 01:14:23.093
Do you want me
to go to the hospital?

01:14:23.923 --> 01:14:27.683
Look, Mom. Whether you
spend time with us or not..

01:14:27.893 --> 01:14:30.273
Whether we go out
as a family or not..

01:14:30.513 --> 01:14:33.443
Whether you drop us
in the school daily or not..

01:14:33.753 --> 01:14:36.563
Whatever you do or not do,
you are my mother.

01:14:36.913 --> 01:14:42.893
But, in RK Hospital, you are
Dr. Radhi only if you help others.

01:14:46.003 --> 01:14:48.903
Whatever you do,
we like you, Mom.

01:14:49.243 --> 01:14:51.403
We know that
it's the same for you.

01:15:02.053 --> 01:15:03.233
What are you going to do now?

01:16:26.033 --> 01:16:26.863
Sir?

01:16:29.033 --> 01:16:30.903
They said that it's very critical.

01:17:33.823 --> 01:17:35.513
Ma'am, how are you?

01:17:36.303 --> 01:17:37.173
Prepare the scrubs.

01:17:37.713 --> 01:17:38.533
Okay, ma'am.

01:18:25.333 --> 01:18:27.233
Ma'am, the babies are collapsing.

01:18:27.343 --> 01:18:28.623
The babies are still alive, right?

01:18:29.683 --> 01:18:30.523
Ma'am?

01:18:30.703 --> 01:18:33.303
I mean, the babies are still alive.
So, we have time.

01:18:33.813 --> 01:18:34.663
Let's go.

01:18:36.733 --> 01:18:37.573
Yes, ma'am.

01:18:39.033 --> 01:18:41.083
Anitha, prepare the
manual ventilation.

01:18:41.153 --> 01:18:43.483
Dr. Preetham and I will
do the heart transplant.

01:18:45.983 --> 01:18:48.343
Reena, bring the defib.

01:18:48.573 --> 01:18:49.513
Okay, ma'am.

01:18:52.373 --> 01:18:54.583
Sir, please shift the heart.

01:19:54.323 --> 01:19:55.823
Anitha, get the sutures..
- Yes, ma'am..

01:20:13.803 --> 01:20:14.653
Good job, guys.

01:20:15.113 --> 01:20:15.933
Thank you, ma'am.

01:20:20.203 --> 01:20:21.043
What's this, Aruna?

01:20:21.753 --> 01:20:25.103
Many new faces have joined.
But, I don't know who they are.

01:20:25.523 --> 01:20:28.423
Yes, ma'am. Three new
intern doctors have joined.

01:20:29.073 --> 01:20:31.403
Plus, a few nurses
have also joined.

01:20:31.843 --> 01:20:35.953
You don't know who they are,
but they know who you are, ma'am.

01:20:37.783 --> 01:20:42.913
Why didn't you arrange a doctor till
the twins' case got so complicated?

01:20:43.823 --> 01:20:46.273
There was a guy named Dr. Raghav..
- Oh..

01:20:46.403 --> 01:20:49.313
It's a long story, ma'am.
You've just come, right?

01:20:49.523 --> 01:20:51.393
I'll tell you
everything patiently, ma'am.

01:20:51.783 --> 01:20:55.633
When everyone was wondering
how to do this surgery

01:20:55.743 --> 01:20:58.233
everyone told me
that you have to come.

01:20:59.973 --> 01:21:05.853
You denied our request so strictly.
So what convinced you?

01:21:06.283 --> 01:21:09.113
How could I not come after
all of you requested me, Aruna?

01:21:10.393 --> 01:21:13.013
More than you convincing me
to come here

01:21:13.223 --> 01:21:16.853
it was harder for me
to convince myself to stay at home.

01:21:17.763 --> 01:21:20.313
Anyway, ma'am,
I'm glad you came.

01:21:20.673 --> 01:21:22.273
You'll be here from now on, right?

01:21:27.403 --> 01:21:30.363
I haven't decided yet.

01:21:31.403 --> 01:21:34.313
I need to think about it
and talk to Arjun.

01:21:35.623 --> 01:21:37.743
Ma'am, thank you for coming.

01:21:42.673 --> 01:21:44.423
Ma'am, my baby..

01:21:44.533 --> 01:21:46.073
Sir, your baby is safe.

01:21:46.553 --> 01:21:48.053
The operation was successful.

01:21:48.093 --> 01:21:50.803
Oh, thank God.
Thank God.

01:21:51.173 --> 01:21:54.123
Ma'am, can I go and see my baby?
- Sir, please wait..

01:21:54.173 --> 01:21:55.493
The surgery just got over.

01:21:55.553 --> 01:21:57.303
The nurse will call you
after the procedures are done.

01:21:57.353 --> 01:21:58.763
You can see them after that.
- Okay, ma'am.

01:21:59.103 --> 01:22:02.133
Ma'am, thank you
for saving my baby.

01:22:02.413 --> 01:22:05.663
If you want to thank someone,
you should thank her.

01:22:06.473 --> 01:22:07.313
Dr. Radhi.

01:22:07.793 --> 01:22:10.743
She came at the right time
and did the surgery successfully.

01:22:11.793 --> 01:22:12.623
Thank you, ma'am.

01:22:13.173 --> 01:22:15.543
Please update me on what happened
in my absence.. - Ma'am..

01:22:15.733 --> 01:22:16.573
Definitely, ma'am.

01:22:16.713 --> 01:22:18.493
Amritha's husband, ma'am.
- Okay..

01:22:18.583 --> 01:22:21.373
Ma'am, thank you so much
for saving my baby.

01:22:22.243 --> 01:22:24.153
As soon as they are here..
- Dr. Preetham!

01:22:24.613 --> 01:22:25.443
Please come here.

01:22:27.333 --> 01:22:30.873
He and I did the surgery together.
So, the credit goes to him as well.

01:22:31.123 --> 01:22:32.623
Sir, thank you so much.

01:22:32.753 --> 01:22:33.583
It's okay.
- Thanks a lot, sir.

01:22:34.023 --> 01:22:37.483
Ma'am, I've been here since my wife
was admitted in this hospital.

01:22:38.223 --> 01:22:40.033
All the doctors and nurses here

01:22:40.603 --> 01:22:44.363
kept saying that
Dr. Radhi should be here.

01:22:45.223 --> 01:22:48.053
I didn't even know
who you were, ma'am.

01:22:48.743 --> 01:22:52.873
I believe that this surgery was
successful only because of you.

01:22:54.773 --> 01:22:56.403
We are indebted to you, ma'am.

01:22:57.193 --> 01:22:59.193
Thank you so much
for saving my baby.

01:23:00.983 --> 01:23:02.723
Thank you.
Thanks a lot.

01:23:05.203 --> 01:23:06.793
Thank you, ma'am.
- Take care.

01:23:20.953 --> 01:23:21.813
Thanks.

01:23:22.183 --> 01:23:23.003
For what?

01:23:24.843 --> 01:23:25.673
For this surgery.

01:23:26.353 --> 01:23:29.093
Oh. Will you thank everyone
who did the surgery?

01:23:29.483 --> 01:23:31.663
Did you thank Naveen and Anitha?

01:23:32.913 --> 01:23:35.543
No, I wanted to thank you.

01:23:37.733 --> 01:23:38.563
Why just me?

01:23:40.803 --> 01:23:44.113
You said that Dr. Radhi
should do this surgery.

01:23:44.593 --> 01:23:45.753
I should have listened to you.

01:23:46.593 --> 01:23:48.643
If I had, this situation
wouldn't have become so bad.

01:23:50.903 --> 01:23:51.753
One minute.

01:23:54.703 --> 01:23:57.073
You said that Dr. Radhi left
this hospital because of me.

01:23:58.723 --> 01:24:02.853
Now, I spoke to her
and made her come back.

01:24:04.043 --> 01:24:05.063
What should I do about that?

01:24:05.653 --> 01:24:06.473
No.

01:24:07.503 --> 01:24:09.143
I just said it.

01:24:11.473 --> 01:24:12.343
Anyway..

01:24:12.623 --> 01:24:17.573
I should thank you for keeping
your ego aside and talking to her.

01:24:19.373 --> 01:24:21.573
It's good that
she came back to this hospital.

01:24:22.993 --> 01:24:26.153
I thought about
what you said at the party.

01:24:28.543 --> 01:24:31.573
I know we can't be
what we used to be.

01:24:32.153 --> 01:24:32.983
I can see that.

01:24:35.573 --> 01:24:36.403
But..

01:24:36.943 --> 01:24:37.803
But what?

01:24:39.983 --> 01:24:41.943
We can be friends, right?

01:24:44.733 --> 01:24:46.153
We work in the same hospital.

01:24:48.383 --> 01:24:52.123
It doesn't feel good to glare at
each other every time we pass by.

01:24:56.813 --> 01:24:57.653
Friends?

01:25:07.853 --> 01:25:08.703
Arjun.

01:25:11.703 --> 01:25:12.743
What's your name?

01:25:18.823 --> 01:25:20.003
'You don't know my name.'

01:25:20.733 --> 01:25:22.613
'On top of that, I'm drunk.'

01:25:24.353 --> 01:25:26.733
'Yet you brought me
to your hostel.'

01:25:29.763 --> 01:25:30.583
'I don't know.'

01:25:31.033 --> 01:25:33.033
'I've never done this before.'

01:25:34.013 --> 01:25:34.873
'But..'

01:25:35.643 --> 01:25:38.403
'I felt safe when I came with you.'

01:25:43.013 --> 01:25:44.713
'You're the first person
who said that I'm safe.'

01:25:49.903 --> 01:25:50.733
'I'm Arjun.'

01:25:52.943 --> 01:25:53.763
'I'm Reena.'

01:25:58.053 --> 01:25:58.873
Reena.

01:26:03.143 --> 01:26:04.003
'Now what?'

01:26:04.343 --> 01:26:05.833
'You need a reason
to break up with me.'

01:26:06.313 --> 01:26:07.563
'I understand..
- Dr. Guna..'

01:26:07.983 --> 01:26:09.733
'What?
- An emergency..'

01:26:11.273 --> 01:26:14.623
'Ma'am, the hospital
is always open for you.'

01:26:15.513 --> 01:26:16.643
'You can come back anytime..
- Arjun..'

01:26:17.273 --> 01:26:19.443
'I don't have any problem
working here.'

01:26:19.963 --> 01:26:21.063
'But I have some conditions.'

